5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! I'm so excited to play this game with everyone! It's like a big mystery adventure! I'm going to use my super-detective skills to find the werewolf! Does anyone have a cool plan to start with?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's maintain a calm and methodical approach. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we focus on observing everyone's behavior and speech patterns. Logic and evidence should be our priority over intuition.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since we have no clues yet, we should focus on how everyone reacts to the pressure. Let's keep the conversation open and see who tries to steer the narrative too early.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with the need for observation. Let's avoid making rash assumptions based on personality. I'll be paying close attention to any contradictions that arise as we begin to share our thoughts.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Observation is a fine start, but let's not be too passive. I'll be watching to see who tries too hard to blend into the ""logical"" consensus. It's often the most calculated masks that hide the wolf.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, a mask! That sounds so spooky! Hehe, like a masquerade party! But I'll be watching everyone's faces really closely to see if they're hiding something. Do you think the wolf is acting super nice right now?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"It is impossible to determine a role based on kindness alone, Rin. Both a villager and a werewolf can be polite. We must look for inconsistencies in logic rather than judging someone's temperament.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio is correct. Temperament is a poor metric for guilt. However, I am interested in how people respond to these early warnings. If someone becomes overly defensive about their ""kindness,"" that could be a tell.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, that is a valid point. However, we must also be careful not to mistake social awkwardness or a natural lack of confidence for defensiveness. Let's focus on the actual content of the statements.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you're far too lenient. In a game of deception, every hesitation and every carefully chosen word is data. I'm less interested in ""social awkwardness"" and more in who is strategically playing the role of the mediator.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're making this sound like a real spy movie! I'm getting goosebumps! Hehe! But if everyone is just watching each other, who's going to be the first one to find a clue? I'll be the bravest detective here!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Bravery is admirable, Rin, but in this game, it can be reckless. The first ""clue"" will likely come from the Seer's divination tonight. Until then, the most productive action is to listen and record.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, you're right. The Seer's information will be our first concrete lead. Until then, I'll be analyzing the dynamics of this group. I'm curious to see who will try to lead the village once that information surfaces.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. The Seer's role is critical, but we must also consider how the Werewolf might attempt to manipulate that information. I will be watching for anyone who tries to discredit the Seer or steer the vote too aggressively.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"It seems we are all quite focused on the Seer. While that is the obvious path, remember that the Possessed will be the one most eager to ""help"" the Seer's findings align with the wolf's goals. I'll be watching for that synergy.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, the Possessed! That's like a secret sidekick for the wolf! This is getting so complicated, but it's super exciting! I'll keep my eyes wide open tonight. Good luck to the Seer! Bye-bye everyone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with the general consensus. Let us proceed to the night phase with a clear mind. I will be reflecting on today's discourse to identify any subtle patterns. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I've enjoyed our initial exchange. Let's see if the reality of tomorrow matches the theories we've discussed today. I wish you all a peaceful night. Good night.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we have established a reasonable framework for our observations. I will be analyzing the discourse tomorrow with a critical eye. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,"A predictable start. You all seem quite content with your ""logical"" frameworks. I shall retire now and see which of these carefully constructed personas begins to crack tomorrow. Good night.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
